/opt/formal-conjectures/FormalConjectures/Wikipedia/Hall.lean:27:- L. Danilov, *The Diophantine equation $x^3 - y^2 = k$ and Hall's conjecture*, Mathematical notes of the Academy of Sciences of the USSR 32 (1982): 617-618
/opt/formal-conjectures/FormalConjectures/Wikipedia/Hall.lean:37:def HallConjectureExp (e : ℝ) : Prop := ∃ C : ℝ, C > 0 ∧ HallIneq C e
